WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.770
These six dimensions give us a practical checklist
Accuracy asks

00:00:05.796 --> 00:00:11.535
whether a value reflects reality Completeness asks
whether required information

00:00:11.549 --> 00:00:17.312
is present Consistency asks whether the same concept
is represented compatibly

00:00:19.047 --> 00:00:24.839
Timeliness asks whether the data is current enough
Uniqueness asks whether entities

00:00:24.865 --> 00:00:30.602
appear the intended number of times Validity checks
whether values follow documented

00:00:30.628 --> 00:00:36.272
rules The dimensions can overlap so treat them as a
way to organize

00:00:36.285 --> 00:00:39.351
investigation rather than as perfectly separate
boxes
